{
  "openapi": "3.1.1",
  "info": {
    "title": "ExhibitOS Institution API",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Tenant-scoped institution custody mappings over existing authorized artworks. Tokens contain explicit scopes/collection/artwork IDs; current issuer admin membership and expiry/revocation/quota are checked. Cookie operations require CSRF; Host and write Origin are checked. GET paging persists bounded cursors and needs CSRF when using cookies. Bulk keeps malformed-row results and supports explicit batch rollback without deleting artwork or rewriting rights. Export requires current artwork export permission. No anonymous institution publication or model download. Inventory extensions distinguish bibliography, exhibition and conservation history. Export includes the current artwork rights including copyright/credit without replacing them with institutional metadata."
  },
